1193
00:03:16,137 --> 00:03:20,547
My wound has healed, so you don't have to take responsibility anymore.

1194
00:03:20,897 --> 00:03:23,757
You can break off the engagement.

1195
00:03:25,347 --> 00:03:27,387
The wound hasn't healed.

1196
00:03:27,387 --> 00:03:29,777
I will never break off our engagement.

1197
00:03:29,927 --> 00:03:32,447
