I heard music is good for vegetables, too!

1373
00:05:14,277 --> 00:05:15,747
Please!

1374
00:05:17,717 --> 00:05:21,347
Oh, fine...

1375
00:05:21,617 --> 00:05:24,227
Thank you very much, Alan-sama!

1376
00:05:25,047 --> 00:05:29,977
But sadly, Alan-sama still seems 
to be unaware of his own feelings.

1377
00:05:31,137 --> 00:05:34,987
Mary Hunt-sama also loves Catarina-sama.

1378
00:05:35,397 --> 00:05:38,757
In fact, she's plotted quite a terrifying plan.

1379
00:05:39,867 --> 00:05:44,617
I'm not fit for a position so important as a prince's consort.

1380
00:05:44,617 --> 00:05:47,987
If you're unfit, then it's even more impossible for me.

1381
00:05:47,987 --> 00:05:49,957
I have no idea what I'm meant to do.

1382
00:05:49,967 --> 00:05:53,007
Then let's both cancel our engagements

1383
00:05:53,007 --> 00:05:55,087
and flee to somewhere far away!

1384
00:05:56,487 --> 00:05:58,797
It would be nice to live near the sea!

1385
00:05:58,797 --> 00:05:59,897
Yes!

1386
00:05:59,897 --> 00:06:03,237
This island has boats departing 
for the city three times a day.

1387
00:06:03,237 --> 00:06:05,207
We wouldn't have any difficulty getting by!

1388
00:06:05,797 --> 00:06:08,197
You're such a nice girl, Mary.

1389
00:06:08,327 --> 00:06:10,307
But because Catarina-sama is so dense,

1390
00:06:10,307 --> 00:06:14,027
she has no idea that Mary-sama is actually serious.

1391
00:06:15,717 --> 00:06:20,237
Nicol Ascart-sama seems to have 
feelings for Catarina-sama, as well.

1392
00:06:21,007 --> 00:06:25,527
He rarely speaks first to anyone 
or changes his expression,

1393
00:06:26,467 --> 00:06:30,337
but in front of Catarina-sama, even Nicol-sama...

1394
00:06:30,707 --> 00:06:33,347
shows a smile that looks truly happy.

1395
00:06:35,027 --> 00:06:39,567
And Sophia Ascart-sama also loves Catarina-sama.

1396
00:06:40,857 --> 00:06:45,477
Sophia-sama noticed how Nicol-sama, 
her brother, felt before anyone else,

1397
00:06:45,477 --> 00:06:48,867
and she's been trying her hardest 
to get Catarina-sama to realize it...

1398
00:06:49,457 --> 00:06:52,447
My brother is just so kind!

1399
00:06:52,447 --> 00:06:54,897
My brother is just so brave!

1400
00:06:54,897 --> 00:06:57,897
My brother is just so adorable!

1401
00:06:58,187 --> 00:06:59,307
Adorable?

1402
00:06:59,307 --> 00:07:00,227
Yes!

1403
00:07:00,897 --> 00:07:03,907
You're really attached to your brother, aren't you?

1404
00:07:04,397 --> 00:07:07,107
But unfortunately, the message isn't coming through at all.

1405
00:07:08,527 --> 00:07:12,977
And Maria Campbell-sama also loves Catarina-sama.

1406
00:07:14,227 --> 00:07:16,867
Catarina-sama, please eat these.

1407
00:07:18,457 --> 00:07:19,587
Thank you!

1408
00:07:28,697 --> 00:07:30,667
Which is why I say that,

1409
00:07:30,667 --> 00:07:33,597
within certain circles, Catarina-sama is quite popular.

1410
00:07:34,137 --> 00:07:37,897
What is it about Catarina-sama 
that draws people to her?

1411
00:07:43,777 --> 00:07:46,707
In truth, I know the answer to that.

1412
00:07:48,977 --> 00:07:51,237
Then we'll see you again this evening.

1413
00:07:51,237 --> 00:07:53,207
Yes, I look forward to it.

1414
00:07:53,207 --> 00:07:54,837
Is something happening this evening?

1415
00:07:55,067 --> 00:07:57,727
We're all having pajama party.

1416
00:07:57,727 --> 00:07:59,857
All of you? A pajama party?

1417
00:07:59,857 --> 00:08:02,497
What exactly do you do at a pajama party?

1418
00:08:02,577 --> 00:08:04,597
We all get together in our pajamas,

1419
00:08:04,597 --> 00:08:06,277
eating delicious snacks,

1420
00:08:06,277 --> 00:08:08,467
and spend time chatting together.

1421
00:08:08,647 --> 00:08:10,927
That sounds delightful.

1422
00:08:11,097 --> 00:08:12,727
Oh, I know!

1423
00:08:12,727 --> 00:08:14,977
Why don't you boys have a boys-only party?

1424
00:08:16,177 --> 00:08:18,007
What are you talking about, Sister?

1425
00:08:18,357 --> 00:08:20,377
That's never going to happen.

1426
00:08:20,377 --> 00:08:22,987
Aw, Keith, why not?

1427
00:08:22,987 --> 00:08:24,937
A boys-only party would be lovely!

1428
00:08:24,937 --> 00:08:27,957
You can spend the whole night talking about boy stuff!

1429
00:08:27,957 --> 00:08:30,387
No, that wouldn't be the least bit lovely.

1430
00:08:31,027 --> 00:08:34,347
I don't even know what we'd talk about all night.

1431
00:08:34,807 --> 00:08:37,327
Nicol-sama, you agree with me, right?

1432
00:08:38,087 --> 00:08:40,837
The whole night... talking about boy stuff?

1433
00:08:41,017 --> 00:08:43,457
Wait, are you serious, Nicol-sama?

1434
00:08:43,457 --> 00:08:44,647
I think it sounds fun.

1435
00:08:44,647 --> 00:08:45,847
What?!

1436
00:08:45,847 --> 00:08:47,387
You, too, Alan-sama?!

1437
00:08:47,387 --> 00:08:48,627
We still have time.

1438
00:08:48,627 --> 00:08:50,217
Wait, you two...

1439
00:08:50,217 --> 00:08:54,537
<i>Just the boys... talking all night?</i>

1440
00:09:02,917 --> 00:09:05,237
Catarina-sama! What is all this?

1441
00:09:05,417 --> 00:09:08,317
They're my pajamas for the party tonight.

1442
00:09:08,977 --> 00:09:11,457
I just can't decide which ones to wear.

1443
00:09:12,497 --> 00:09:14,227
I'm thinking of wearing these

1444
00:09:14,227 --> 00:09:15,077
What do you think?

1445
00:09:18,457 --> 00:09:22,167
You look lovely, but aren't there any other options?

1446
00:09:22,167 --> 00:09:23,947
Really?

1447
00:09:24,447 --> 00:09:25,557
Then...

1448
00:09:29,767 --> 00:09:33,007
How about these? They light up in the dark!

1449
00:09:38,317 --> 00:09:41,287
I think, perhaps, something a bit more subdued...

1450
00:09:41,287 --> 00:09:43,697
Aw!

1451
00:09:45,977 --> 00:09:49,187
It's not a girls-only party without love talk!

1452
00:09:49,527 --> 00:09:52,247
Does anyone here have a sweetheart?

1453
00:09:55,367 --> 00:09:58,217
Yeah, I guess none of us do...

1454
00:09:58,677 --> 00:09:59,807
<i>All right!</i>

1455
00:09:59,807 --> 00:10:03,707
<i>There's still no relationship progress between 
Maria and the conquerable characters!</i>

1456
00:10:03,707 --> 00:10:07,637
<i>Which means there can't be any doom flags triggered yet!</i>

1457
00:10:09,297 --> 00:10:12,927
That reminded me that there's 
something I wanted to ask all of you.

1458
00:10:13,287 --> 00:10:16,977
If you were seeing someone, 
what would you want to do with them?

1459
00:10:16,977 --> 00:10:17,767
Huh?

1460
00:10:18,367 --> 00:10:19,897
I'm not sure...

1461
00:10:19,897 --> 00:10:23,017
Catarina-sama, please give us your answer!

1462
00:10:23,077 --> 00:10:26,427
Um, let me think...

1463
00:10:26,427 --> 00:10:32,247
I guess I'd want to make them a meal 
from the vegetables I raised.

1464
00:10:35,407 --> 00:10:38,407
Okay, next! What about you, Maria?

1465
00:10:38,407 --> 00:10:41,247
Um... I...

1466
00:10:41,997 --> 00:10:45,187
I'd want to make sweets for them.

1467
00:10:45,187 --> 00:10:47,657
I'm learning how to cook, too,

1468
00:10:47,657 --> 00:10:50,167
so when I get good at it, I'd want to cook for them.

1469
00:10:50,167 --> 00:10:53,707
Your cooking would be amazing, Maria!

1470
00:10:53,707 --> 00:10:54,917
I want to taste-test it!

1471
00:10:55,087 --> 00:10:56,467
Yes, of course!

1472
00:10:56,697 --> 00:10:58,247
What about you, Mary-sama?

1473
00:10:58,247 --> 00:11:02,487
I'd want to eat meals with them, bathe with them...

1474
00:11:03,827 --> 00:11:05,457
B-Bathe?

1475
00:11:05,457 --> 00:11:07,347
And we could comb each other's hair...

1476
00:11:07,347 --> 00:11:10,967
Oh, and we could style each other's hair...

1477
00:11:10,967 --> 00:11:12,857
And we could trade dresses!

1478
00:11:13,017 --> 00:11:13,947
Huh?

1479
00:11:13,947 --> 00:11:17,337
You wouldn't trade dresses with a boy, would you?

1480
00:11:17,337 --> 00:11:20,797
What? Does the partner have to be a boy?

1481
00:11:20,797 --> 00:11:23,337
Well, I just assumed it would be...

1482
00:11:23,457 --> 00:11:24,617
Huh?

1483
00:11:24,617 --> 00:11:27,127
In that case, I can't think of anything.

1484
00:11:27,127 --> 00:11:30,947
I'm happier when I'm with you, Catarina-sama.

1485
00:11:31,507 --> 00:11:34,087
All right, Sophia-sama, you're last.

1486
00:11:34,277 --> 00:11:37,367
My wishes are all ordinary things.

1487
00:11:37,367 --> 00:11:40,177
Like visiting bookstores together...

1488
00:11:40,177 --> 00:11:41,097
Uh-huh!

1489
00:11:41,377 --> 00:11:45,547
And fighting together for the good of our country,

1490
00:11:45,547 --> 00:11:48,727
freeing their heart from the darkness lurking within it,

1491
00:11:49,217 --> 00:11:52,497
undoing the curse placed on them by an evil witch,

1492
00:11:52,497 --> 00:11:56,597
searching for the legendary ring so 
we can explore the world of the gods,

1493
00:11:53,787 --> 00:11:55,077
These are ordinary?

1494
00:11:56,617 --> 00:11:59,877
singing for the people who are fighting for a revolution...

1495
00:11:56,997 --> 00:12:00,827
Um, Catarina-sama, is this...

1496
00:12:00,197 --> 00:12:02,527
Even though they were abducted as a child

1497
00:12:00,907 --> 00:12:04,567
Yeah... This all happened in a romance novel.

1498
00:12:02,527 --> 00:12:05,447
and taken in by a family of traveling performers...

1499
00:12:04,567 --> 00:12:07,667
I borrowed it from her and read it a while ago.

1500
00:12:08,207 --> 00:12:12,697
By the way, Anne, has there been 
any talk of marriage for you?

1501
00:12:12,697 --> 00:12:15,827
Perhaps it's already been 
decided who your partner will be?

1502
00:12:15,827 --> 00:12:17,587
Really? What are they like?

1503
00:12:17,667 --> 00:12:19,367
Please tell us!

1504
00:12:20,717 --> 00:12:22,537
There is no such person.

1505
00:12:22,537 --> 00:12:26,977
I have no desire to get married, anyway.

1506
00:12:27,097 --> 00:12:28,047
What?

1507
00:12:28,047 --> 00:12:29,377
You don't?

1508
00:12:29,377 --> 00:12:30,727
Why not?

1509
00:12:32,417 --> 00:12:33,787
Well...

1510
00:12:39,617 --> 00:12:41,137
I know!

1511
00:12:41,137 --> 00:12:43,747
I have a question for all of you, too!

1512
00:12:43,747 --> 00:12:46,857
If you could be reborn, what would you want to be?

1513
00:12:46,857 --> 00:12:48,357
Reborn?!

1514
00:12:48,357 --> 00:12:51,247
That happens in lots of romance novels, too!

1515
00:12:51,247 --> 00:12:55,307
I'd want to be a princess 
in a forbidden relationship with a knight!

1516
00:12:55,647 --> 00:12:58,367
Maybe a female knight who dresses as a man,

1517
00:12:55,647 --> 00:12:59,107
I'd have to say a man of higher 
status than Prince Geordo.

1518
00:12:58,367 --> 00:13:01,047
or a nun who's fled from her convent,

1519
00:12:59,107 --> 00:13:02,187
Let's see... I think...

1520
00:13:01,047 --> 00:13:03,257
or a fairy who falls in love with a human,

1521
00:13:03,257 --> 00:13:05,387
or a legendary holy sword...

1522
00:13:04,437 --> 00:13:07,067
Anne, it's late. Go get some rest.

1523
00:13:07,067 --> 00:13:10,027
Very well. I will take my leave, then.

1524
00:13:10,317 --> 00:13:11,857
Goodnight.

1525
00:13:12,207 --> 00:13:14,067
Goodnight!

1526
00:13:20,287 --> 00:13:25,027
<i>I was born to Baron Shelley and one of his maids.</i>

1527
00:13:26,087 --> 00:13:28,977
<i>I did exactly as my mother wished,</i>

1528
00:13:28,977 --> 00:13:32,547
<i>behaving meekly and submissively 
so that the baron would like me.</i>

1529
00:13:33,327 --> 00:13:35,917
<i>I was convinced that I was happy with that life.</i>

1530
00:13:37,077 --> 00:13:38,007
<i>However...</i>

1531
00:13:40,777 --> 00:13:42,967
<i>When I was fifteen years old,</i>

1532
00:13:43,217 --> 00:13:45,257
<i>my mother died in a fire.</i>

1533
00:13:52,187 --> 00:13:53,727
With that scar,

1534
00:13:53,917 --> 00:13:56,607
you're of no use to me as a political marriage pawn.

1535
00:13:56,937 --> 00:13:59,867
I have no further need of you. Leave this house.

1536
00:14:02,477 --> 00:14:06,257
<i>The baron never had any interest in me at all.</i>

1537
00:14:07,327 --> 00:14:09,227
<i>I was only a tool...</i>

1538
00:14:09,787 --> 00:14:12,407
<i>someone he didn't need anymore.</i>

1539
00:14:15,207 --> 00:14:20,237
<i>Then I took a job as a maid in the home 
of Duke Claes, a distant relative.</i>

1540
00:14:21,097 --> 00:14:23,767
<i>Catarina-sama was a pampered child,</i>

1541
00:14:23,767 --> 00:14:25,647
<i>making her very selfish and arrogant.</i>

1542
00:14:26,717 --> 00:14:29,947
<i>I only tried to be a useful tool for my master,</i>

1543
00:14:29,947 --> 00:14:32,027
<i>as I had been to the baron.</i>

1544
00:14:32,647 --> 00:14:36,007
<i>I remained meek and submissive, 
with no will of my own.</i>

1545
00:14:37,287 --> 00:14:42,217
<i>But after the events of one day, Catarina-sama changed.</i>

1546
00:14:43,727 --> 00:14:46,067
<i>She was far from the typical well-bred lady.</i>

1547
00:14:46,857 --> 00:14:49,457
<i>I had no idea how I should interact with her,</i>

1548
00:14:49,867 --> 00:14:54,917
<i>but before I knew it, I had learned 
to act of my own will and speak my own mind.</i>

1549
00:14:56,487 --> 00:15:01,547
<i>Around Catarina-sama, who was cheerful, 
energetic, and treated everyone equally,</i>

1550
00:15:02,927 --> 00:15:06,377
<i>I could no longer be just a tool.</i>

1551
00:15:17,467 --> 00:15:20,287
<i>The first birthday present I ever received...</i>

1552
00:15:24,137 --> 00:15:28,987
<i>Catarina-sama accepted and loved me for who I was.</i>

1553
00:15:30,567 --> 00:15:33,407
<i>Then, just when I began to wish</i>

1554
00:15:34,177 --> 00:15:37,117
<i>that I could spend the rest of my life here...</i>

1555
00:15:45,817 --> 00:15:48,367
<i>Your wedding date has been set.</i>

1556
00:15:48,367 --> 00:15:50,997
<i>I will be sending for you. Be ready.</i>

1557
00:15:55,667 --> 00:15:59,407
I found you a partner who's benevolent enough to take you,

1558
00:15:59,627 --> 00:16:02,407
even though you're damaged goods.

1559
00:16:04,977 --> 00:16:08,437
Why are you still standing there?! Get ready at once!

1560
00:16:14,007 --> 00:16:15,887
You're Anne's father, yes?

1561
00:16:17,137 --> 00:16:18,997
My name is Catarina Claes.

1562
00:16:19,277 --> 00:16:20,827
Y-Yes...

1563
00:16:21,337 --> 00:16:22,997
I have a favor to ask.

1564
00:16:22,997 --> 00:16:25,887
Please reconsider making Anne get married!

1565
00:16:27,307 --> 00:16:30,147
I need Anne!

1566
00:16:30,147 --> 00:16:32,017
I want her by my side!

1567
00:16:32,247 --> 00:16:34,167
You can't take her from me!

1568
00:16:35,227 --> 00:16:39,227
Let me tell you just how important 
and necessary Anne is to me!

1569
00:16:39,227 --> 00:16:40,537
First, in the mornings,

1570
00:16:40,537 --> 00:16:43,827
she always wakes me up when I sleep too late

1571
00:16:43,827 --> 00:16:45,447
and fixes my hair for me!

1572
00:16:45,667 --> 00:16:48,457
No, wait! I need to go back ever further!

1573
00:16:49,067 --> 00:16:54,537
Um... I'm a restless sleeper, 
so I always kick my blanket off,

1574
00:16:54,537 --> 00:16:56,767
but Anne always gets up at least once per night

1575
00:16:56,767 --> 00:16:58,867
to fix my blanket for me!

1576
00:16:59,027 --> 00:17:01,247
Please let Anne stay with me!

1577
00:17:01,357 --> 00:17:02,377
Please!

1578
00:17:09,287 --> 00:17:10,847
I would like...

1579
00:17:12,147 --> 00:17:13,977
to decline this marriage offer.

1580
00:17:13,977 --> 00:17:14,937
What?!

1581
00:17:15,617 --> 00:17:18,177
I will not be ordered around by you, Father.

1582
00:17:18,177 --> 00:17:20,687
What did you say?! Watch your tongue!

1583
00:17:26,167 --> 00:17:27,347
Pardon me.

1584
00:17:29,307 --> 00:17:30,277
Baron...

1585
00:17:31,587 --> 00:17:34,107
I would like to speak with you for a moment.

1586
00:17:53,157 --> 00:17:58,657
<i>Catarina-sama made me into the person named Anne Shelley.</i>

1587
00:18:03,237 --> 00:18:06,867
<i>I will follow her wherever she goes.</i>

1588
00:18:07,937 --> 00:18:12,907
<i>By Catarina-sama's side is where I am truly happy.</i>

1589
00:18:23,647 --> 00:18:24,877
Geordo-sama.

1590
00:18:25,207 --> 00:18:27,207
A letter has arrived for you.

1591
00:18:27,347 --> 00:18:28,737
It's from Catarina?

1592
00:18:29,107 --> 00:18:31,457
How unusual for her to take the trouble to write.

1593
00:18:32,407 --> 00:18:34,647
<i>Dear Geordo Stuart-sama,</i>

1594
00:18:34,647 --> 00:18:37,627
<i>Please come to the terrace 
in the garden behind the school.</i>

1595
00:18:37,627 --> 00:18:39,427
<i>I'll be waiting for you.</i>

1596
00:18:39,427 --> 00:18:41,147
<i>Catarina Claes.</i>

1597
00:18:41,627 --> 00:18:46,287
<i>The normal Catarina wouldn't choose 
such an elegant, showy card...</i>

1598
00:18:46,927 --> 00:18:49,577
<i>And asking me to come 
to a place that's usually deserted...</i>

1599
00:18:50,277 --> 00:18:51,527
<i>Could this be...</i>

1600
00:18:52,487 --> 00:18:54,007
Geordo-sama...

1601
00:18:54,667 --> 00:18:58,387
I've finally realized how I feel.

1602
00:18:58,387 --> 00:19:00,457
You are the one I...

1603
00:19:02,337 --> 00:19:04,457
<i>No, wait. Calm down.</i>

1604
00:19:05,157 --> 00:19:06,887
<i>This is Catarina we're talking about.</i>

1605
00:19:06,887 --> 00:19:08,987
<i>It couldn't be something that amorous.</i>

1606
00:19:08,987 --> 00:19:11,347
<i>It must be something else.</i>

1607
00:19:09,257 --> 00:19:11,637
It's the latest model of toy snake!

1608
00:19:11,967 --> 00:19:14,777
<i>Still, as her fiancé,</i>

1609
00:19:14,777 --> 00:19:17,587
<i>I can't decline this invitation.</i>

1610
00:19:18,277 --> 00:19:20,927
<i>Maybe I should prepare a gift to give her.</i>

1611
00:19:21,817 --> 00:19:23,127
<i>Considering the occasion,</i>

1612
00:19:23,127 --> 00:19:26,237
<i>it should be the thing that would make her happiest...</i>

1613
00:19:27,647 --> 00:19:32,817
The shears I always use haven't 
been cutting as well, as of late.

1614
00:19:35,987 --> 00:19:37,717
<i>Gardening shears...</i>

1615
00:19:38,547 --> 00:19:39,547
<i>But...</i>

1616
00:19:40,287 --> 00:19:44,827
<i>That couldn't possibly be any less romantic.</i>

1617
00:19:45,097 --> 00:19:50,177
<i>It doesn't seem like a gift 
that a prince should give his fiancée.</i>

1618
00:19:51,757 --> 00:19:54,177
<i>Still, I have confidence</i>

1619
00:19:54,727 --> 00:19:58,137
<i>that she'll like it far more than any</i>

1620
00:19:58,527 --> 00:20:00,567
<i>gaudy, extravagant ornament.</i>

1621
00:20:01,427 --> 00:20:05,367
<i>I haven't been watching her from right 
by her side all these years for nothing.</i>

1622
00:20:07,467 --> 00:20:10,657
Since that's settled, I must arrange her gift right away!

1623
00:20:10,867 --> 00:20:14,497
I'll have it engraved with her name, 
put it in a fine case, and...

1624
00:20:14,447 --> 00:20:14,807
What's gotten into Geordo-sama?

1625
00:20:14,807 --> 00:20:16,567
What's gotten into Geordo-sama?

1626
00:20:16,557 --> 00:20:16,657
What's gotten into Geordo-sama?

1627
00:20:16,657 --> 00:20:16,907
How unusual. He's absolutely giddy.

1628
